So we have sokoban, we have master mind, what about introducing the game
of memo/concentration.  I know, that it's easy to take notes, but it's
just as easy as reding soko-spoilers.  Every player can decide to do it
with or without notes.

My idea - the memo-levels are filled with special kind of traps.  The
trap when stepped onto generates a particular type of monster.  When one
steps on two traps generating the same type, they both vanish.  When all
traps vanish, stairs to a new level appear.

To prevent farming, there should be some very uncool penalty for
stepping on the trap the third time (and further).  Luck penalties,
maybe even equipment curses.

Dunno, how the traps should be placed.  Checkboard-like, some other
regular way, or maybe completely irregularry...

Dunno where should it be put.  As for sokoban and castle drawbridge,
they are both unobligatory to ascend.  Maybe this could be another
branch with prize at the end?

What do you think?
